up.); [medium] Consumer errors causing repeated rebalances (next check: Check consumer group status for errors or rebalances.); [medium] Hot partition / key skew concentrating load (next check: Analyze partition distribution and load metrics.)\n\n## 3. Correlation (A2)\ncandidate=incident-001; correlated_signals=['sig-sample', 'consumer_lag']; dependency_path=Payments Settlement -> consumer_lag\n\n## 4. Priority / Severity (A3)\nP2 - The consumer lag of 60000 messages exceeds the static threshold of 50000, indicating a likely issue with downstream processing, which could lead to delayed or failed payments.\n\n## 5. Remediation recommendation (A5)\n  - Compare consumer throughput vs input rate (approval_required=True; verify: Check if consumer throughput matches or exceeds input rate.; rollback: No rollback necessary as this is a read-only diagnostic.)\n  - Check consumer group status for errors or rebalances (approval_required=True; verify: Look for any reported errors or rebalances in the consumer group.; rollback: No rollback necessary as this is a read-only diagnostic.)\n  - Analyze partition distribution and load metrics (approval_required=True; verify: Check if any partitions are overloaded compared to others.; rollback: No rollback necessary as this is a read-only diagnostic.)\n  - Check the number of consumer instances against the partition count (approval_required=True; verify: Compare the number of consumer instances to the partition count.; rollback: No rollback necessary as this is a read-only diagnostic.)\n\n## 6. Business impact\nPayments delayed or failed; settlement backlog; SLA/regulatory risk\n\n## 7. Stakeholders to notify\n  - app_owner: payments-app-owner@example.com\n  - business_owner: payments-biz-owner@example.com\n  - prod_support: prodsupport-payments@example.com\n  - sre: sre-streaming@example.com\n  - on_call: pager:payments-oncall / #inc-payments\n"}, "a7": {"recipients_by_role": {"app_owner": "payments-app-owner@example.com", "business_