er@example.com\n  - prod_support: prodsupport-payments@example.com\n  - sre: sre-streaming@example.com\n  - on_call: pager:payments-oncall / #inc-payments\n"}, "a7": {"recipients_by_role": {"app_owner": "payments-app-owner@example.com", "business_owner": "payments-biz-owner@example.com", "prod_support": "prodsupport-payments@example.com", "sre": "sre-streaming@example.com", "on_call": "pager:payments-oncall / #inc-payments"}, "message": "A confirmed P1 incident has been identified in the Payments Settlement service due to a consumer lag of 125,000 messages, significantly exceeding the static threshold of 50,000. This situation poses a risk of delayed or failed payments and potential regulatory issues. Investigations are underway to determine the root cause, with initial diagnostics focusing on consumer throughput and group status. Immediate attention is required to mitigate the impact on payment processing.", "channel": "email", "escalation_reason": "Critical issue with consumer lag affecting payment processing.", "delivery_status": "not_sent"}, "a8": {"recovery_status": "monitoring", "metrics_before_after": {"consumer_lag_before": 125000, "consumer_lag_after": null}, "closure_recommendation": "continue_monitoring", "feedback_record": {"incident_id": "incident-001", "summary": "The consumer lag remains at 125,000 messages, significantly exceeding the threshold of 50,000. Further diagnostics are required to identify the root cause and implement remediation.", "next_steps": ["Continue monitoring consumer lag metrics.", "Perform diagnostics on consumer throughput vs input rate.", "Check consumer group status for errors or rebalances."]}}}}
