xposure in ATM/card transactions\n\n## 7. Stakeholders to notify\n  - app_owner: fraud-app-owner@example.com\n  - business_owner: fraud-biz-owner@example.com\n  - prod_support: prodsupport-fraud@example.com\n  - sre: sre-ml@example.com\n  - on_call: pager:fraud-oncall / #inc-fraud\n"}, "a7": {"recipients_by_role": {"app_owner": "fraud-app-owner@example.com", "business_owner": "fraud-biz-owner@example.com", "prod_support": "prodsupport-fraud@example.com", "sre": "sre-ml@example.com", "on_call": "pager:fraud-oncall / #inc-fraud"}, "message": "Attention: The fraud scoring consumer group is experiencing a significant lag of 90,000 messages, exceeding the static threshold of 50,000. This is likely causing delays in fraud detection and may expose unscored fraud in ATM and card transactions. Immediate investigation is required to determine the root cause and implement remediation steps. Please prioritize this issue as it has been classified with a P2 severity level.", "channel": "email", "escalation_reason": "Critical delay in fraud scoring impacting business operations.", "delivery_status": "not_sent"}, "a8": {"recovery_status": "monitoring", "metrics_before_after": {"consumer_lag": {"before": 90000, "after": 90000}}, "closure_recommendation": "continue_monitoring", "feedback_record": {"incident_id": "incident-001", "summary": "The fraud scoring consumer group continues to experience a significant lag of 90,000 messages, which exceeds the static threshold of 50,000. This indicates ongoing issues that require further investigation and monitoring.", "business_impact": "Fraud scoring delayed; potential unscored fraud exposure in ATM/card transactions.", "next_steps": ["Continue monitoring consumer lag metrics.", "Investigate root causes including consumer throughput and potential errors."]}}}}
